{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15283","headline":"长安书事寄薛戴 · 李端","name":"长安书事寄薛戴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朔雁去成行，哀蝉响如昨。\n时芳一憔悴，暮序何萧索。\n笑语且无聊，逢迎多约略。\n三山不可见，百岁空挥霍。\n故事尽爲愁，新知无复乐。\n夫君又离别，而我加寂寞。\n惠远纵相寻，陶潜祗独酌。\n主人恩则厚，客子才自薄。\n委曲见提携，因循成蹇剥。\n论边书未上，招隐诗还作。\n贵者已朝餐，岂能敦宿诺。\n飞禽虽失树，流水长思壑。\n千里寄琼枝，梦寐青山郭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15283.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15283","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}